<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 13.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 13.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 13	Mar 12     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  266.600     267.580     247.020    7.93 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.510     304.510     306.830   -0.43 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.450     156.820     158.970   -0.96 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.670	46.500	47.182   -1.09 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  427.620     425.760     419.180    2.01 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.925     139.325     141.685   -1.24 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.790	15.758	16.185   -2.44 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  217.050     218.090     212.430    2.17 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.849	 1.888   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.568	 1.562	 1.581   -0.82 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  183.400     181.505     183.135   -0.14%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
